{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2017-biology-24","exam":"MDEET","year":2017,"subject":"biology","number":24,"points":5,"unitId":"gene","unitLabel":"분자생물학·유전자 발현","topic":"DNA·돌연변이·염기쌍","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["gene","biomol","micro"],"stem":"다음은돌연변이원a～d와이에의한DNA 상의돌연변이가\n아미노산서열에미치는영향에대한자료이다.\n<자료Ⅰ>\n◦a : 시토신을탈아민시켜우라실로바꾼다.\n◦b : 티민유사체로서염기전이(transition)를유발한다.\n◦c : 구아닌을변형하여염기전환(transversion)을유발한다.\n◦d : 이웃한염기쌍사이에끼어든다(intercalation).\n<자료Ⅱ>\n◦야생형유전자X를지닌대장균에a～d를각각처리하였을때,\nX의1～7번아미노산암호화부위에서발견된돌연변이를\n순서없이㉠～㉣로나타냈다.\n이에대한설명으로옳은것만을<보기>에서있는대로고른것은?\n(단, 돌연변이의효과는X의1～7번아미노산암호화부위만고려한다.)\n[5점]\n<보기>\nㄱ. a는침묵돌연변이를일으켰다.\nㄴ. b는종결코돈을생성했다.\nㄷ. c는하나의아미노산을바꾸었다.\nㄹ. d는4 개의아미노산을바꾸었다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t022"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t023"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":["fig-03"],"textItemIds":["t024"]}],"answer":3,"acceptedAnswers":[3],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":775,"height":776,"region":0,"bbox":[14.456,47.948,310.0,310.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-biology-24/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":236,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,447.148,310.4,94.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t015","t016","t017","t018","t019"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-biology-24/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":825,"height":3,"region":0,"bbox":[4.056,931.948,330.0,1.2],"role":"option","overlayTextItemIds":[],"optionNumber":5,"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-biology-24/03.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":9,"sourceRect